1
00:01:42,850 --> 00:01:48,000
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,990
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:54,030
I thought about it all night back home.

4
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:00,880
