8
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:37,680
This is surprising.

9
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,530
I can't see Yun Li
doing something like that.

10
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:42,240
She's not the way people online
make her out to be.

11
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,150
What are you guys talking about?

12
00:02:43,150 --> 00:02:44,030
