16
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,560
Anyway, the process
has reached your stage now.

17
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,130
Look.

18
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,130
Alright.

19
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:53,740
How about you approve it first?

20
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:54,530
