31
00:03:30,370 --> 00:03:32,000
I think she makes good videos.

32
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,410
Can't believe she's this kind of person.

33
00:03:33,410 --> 00:03:34,250
What the heck?

34
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,150
Can they ban

35
