Well, are you used to living there?

291
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:08,670
Her place is really nice!

292
00:16:08,730 --> 00:16:10,790
Even I want to go and rent a room there.

293
00:16:12,630 --> 00:16:13,740
How is the school?

294
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:15,820
Are you getting along well
with your teachers

295
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:17,130
and classmates?

296
00:16:17,710 --> 00:16:18,430
Very well!

297
00:16:18,500 --> 00:16:19,690
Isn't Tang Lin there?

298
00:16:19,690 --> 00:16:20,750
Did anyone ask you?

299
00:16:23,510 --> 00:16:24,320
How is your...

300
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:25,870
your internship

301
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,170
going?

302
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:29,670
Did anyone make things difficult for you?

303
00:16:29,910 --> 00:16:30,720
No.

304
00:16:30,980 --> 00:16:31,670
Really,

305
00:16:31,670 --> 00:16:33,530
i-it's pretty good. Really nice.

306
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:35,120
I just missed home,

307
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:35,820
so I came back.

308
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:37,150
I missed Mom's cooking.

309
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:39,330
You can come back anytime you miss home!

310
00:16:39,330 --> 00:16:41,190
Now you know home is better, huh?

311
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,220
I think you should just

312
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:44,740
stay in Xifu since you're back this time.

313
00:16:44,740 --> 00:16:46,470
Just settle in and take it easy.

314
00:16:46,740 --> 00:16:47,820
Listen...

315
00:16:48,060 --> 00:16:49,120
Your dad means that

316
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:50,030
it's inevitable

317
00:16:50,030 --> 00:16:52,340
to feel uncomfortable sometimes
when you are away from home.

318
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:53,220
But home

319
00:16:53,630 --> 00:16:55,670
will always be your safe haven.

320
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,030
I see that you're unhappy

321
00:17:02,030 --> 00:17:03,530
studying in Nanwu.

322
00:17:03,670 --> 00:17:04,440
Why don't you come back

323
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:06,109
and take the postgraduate exam
in Xifu again?

324
00:17:06,109 --> 00:17:07,880
Don't you really like XUST?

325
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:10,530
Dear,

326
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,369
give this ginger duck

327
00:17:12,390 --> 00:17:12,829
a try.

328
00:17:12,829 --> 00:17:14,430
See if I cooked it well today.

329
00:18:01,220 --> 00:18:02,180
Hello, Tangy.

330
00:18:02,810 --> 00:18:04,010
Are you home, Lili?

331
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:04,940
Yes, I'm home.

332
00:18:04,940 --> 00:18:06,600
I've already finished lunch.

333
00:18:06,940 --> 00:18:08,220
Did your dad scold you?

334
00:18:09,190 --> 00:18:11,170
Isn't he always like that?

335
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,740
How is it? Are your legs still intact?

336
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:15,830
What's wrong with my legs?

337
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:16,580
Didn't your dad claim

338
00:18:16,580 --> 00:18:18,980
that he'd break your legs
when you got home?

339
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:20,880
They're intact.

340
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:22,480
I can still jump around.

341
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:24,570
There doesn't seem to be any big problem.

342
00:18:24,570 --> 00:18:25,850
I can rest easy now.

343
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:27,020
Call me if you need anything.

344
00:18:27,020 --> 00:18:27,880
I'm hanging up.

345
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:28,770
Bye-bye.

346
00:18:40,010 --> 00:18:41,900
She just used her beauty
to climb up the ladder.

347
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:43,220
How shameless.

348
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,010
Is this person...

349
00:18:45,810 --> 00:18:47,290
How rude!

350
00:18:49,190 --> 00:18:51,140
Idle Cloud is beautiful as she is!

351
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:55,980
You're slacking off at work
and playing on your phone?

352
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:57,070
None of your business.

353
00:18:57,070 --> 00:18:57,970
You're not the boss.

354
00:18:57,970 --> 00:18:59,030
Go jump in the lake.

355
00:18:59,270 --> 00:19:00,070
Then who am I?

356
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,440
Fu Zhengchu.

357
00:19:01,510 --> 00:19:02,570
Who is my sister?

358
00:19:02,950 --> 00:19:03,660
Xia Congsheng.

359
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:04,340
Exactly!

360
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,640
She's my sister, and I'm her brother.

361
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,770
What's hers is mine.

362
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,030
You two don't even share
the same family name!

363
00:19:09,030 --> 00:19:09,680
So what?

364
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:11,280
She is my biological sister.

365
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:11,880
You...

366
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:13,630
A gentleman doesn't fight a woman.

367
00:19:13,630 --> 00:19:15,090
Can you show even a little respect?

368
00:19:15,090 --> 00:19:16,150
I'm older than you!

369
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:17,680
Whatever.

370
00:19:18,030 --> 00:19:18,920
With your broken leg,

371
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,830
you're still messing around.

372
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:21,640
Who else would break a leg if not you?

373
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,640
Serves you right.

374
00:19:22,940 --> 00:19:23,880
The doctor said I could

375
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:24,380
get this cast off

376
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:25,140
in just a few days.

377
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:25,480
And then,

378
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:27,240
I'll be a man as free as the wind again.

379
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:28,640
Or as free as a lunatic.

380
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:30,920
Lili is away.

381
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,530
Are you bored?

382
00:19:34,310 --> 00:19:35,480
Lili's only gone back home for a few days.

383
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:37,480
It's not like she's not coming back.

384
00:19:37,830 --> 00:19:40,530
She's pretty,
and that's why she seduces people.

385
00:19:40,530 --> 00:19:41,270
So

386
00:19:41,270 --> 00:19:42,640
Lili went back to Xifu because of what

387
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,640
happened online?

388
00:19:43,810 --> 00:19:45,010
What else could it be?

389
00:19:45,270 --> 00:19:45,860
I thought

390
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:47,480
she had a fight with my uncle.

391
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,290
They are doing just fine.

392
00:19:49,830 --> 00:19:50,770
How do you know?

393
00:19:51,010 --> 00:19:52,320
I am omniscient.

394
00:19:55,700 --> 00:19:56,420
Seriously, how can

395
00:19:56,420 --> 00:19:58,240
these netizens be so brainless?

396
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:00,170
They believe whatever others say!

397
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:02,480
I really hate this kind of cyberbullying.

398
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,180
They made things up

399
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:04,480
and twisted the truth.

400
00:20:11,610 --> 00:20:12,270
No way.

401
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:14,130
I'm going to ask my uncle about it.

402
00:20:22,140 --> 00:20:23,010
Oh, my God.

403
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:24,240
Zhengchu.

404
00:20:25,380 --> 00:20:26,180
Uncle.

405
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:27,440
Perfect timing.

406
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:28,570
I need to talk to you.

407
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:30,640
It's about Lili, right?

408
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,270
Yes.

409
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:33,500
Now we need

410
00:20:33,530 --> 00:20:34,480
to find out

411
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,740
who is behind all this.

412
00:20:35,770 --> 00:20:36,360
I checked

413
00:20:36,390 --> 00:20:37,640
some related information online

414
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:39,510
and found that this person probably has

415
00:20:39,510 --> 00:20:40,840
multiple alt accounts.

416
00:20:41,010 --> 00:20:41,810
But, Uncle,

417
00:20:42,220 --> 00:20:43,880
people who spread rumors online like this

418
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:44,420
are bound

419
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:45,680
to cover their tracks.

420
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:47,210
How about

421
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:48,940
I get someone to track them down?

422
00:20:48,940 --> 00:20:49,720
I have a few friends

423
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,380
who are pros in this area.

424
00:20:53,330 --> 00:20:53,980
If we can find

425
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:55,610
the connections between the accounts

426
00:20:55,610 --> 00:20:56,680
and pinpoint

427
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:57,740
their IP addresses

428
00:20:57,740 --> 00:20:59,110
as well as posting times,

429
00:20:59,110 --> 00:21:00,920
we should be able to narrow it down.

430
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:02,120
If that doesn't work,

431
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:03,830
we can investigate

432
00:21:03,830 --> 00:21:05,490
their relationship with EAW.

433
00:21:06,810 --> 00:21:07,610
Uncle,

434
00:21:07,630 --> 00:21:09,000
you mean

435
00:21:09,030 --> 00:21:11,760
it has something to do
with people in the company?

436
00:21:12,110 --> 00:21:13,420
Just do as I said for now.

437
00:21:13,420 --> 00:21:14,220
Okay.

438
00:21:14,450 --> 00:21:15,330
You can rest assured

439
00:21:15,330 --> 00:21:16,480
leaving this to me.

440
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,310
Those friends of mine

441
00:21:17,310 --> 00:21:18,440
owe me a big favor.

442
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,610
If I ask them for help, they'll

443
00:21:19,610 --> 00:21:20,870
definitely handle it.

444
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,610
But, Uncle,

445
00:21:23,610 --> 00:21:26,380
have you thought about going
to check in on Lili?

446
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:28,880
She must've been very sad
the past few days.

447
00:21:39,270 --> 00:21:40,070
Hello, Li.

448
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:41,180
It's dinner time.

449
00:21:41,180 --> 00:21:43,110
Why are you still not back for dinner?

450
00:21:43,110 --> 00:21:44,440
I'm working part-time.

451
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:45,570
Working part-time?

452
00:21:46,330 --> 00:21:47,480
How many times have I told you

453
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,590
to focus on your studies?

454
00:21:48,590 --> 00:21:49,750
I know. I got it.

455
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:50,550
Li,

456
00:21:50,550 --> 00:21:51,900
please don't tell Dad.

457
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:53,440
Send me your address now.

458
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,370
I'll go meet you.

459
00:21:54,610 --> 00:21:55,530
I'm at work.

460
00:21:55,530 --> 00:21:56,810
What are you coming to me for?

461
00:21:56,810 --> 00:21:57,740
Just send it to me,

462
00:21:57,740 --> 00:21:59,070
or I'll tell Mom and Dad.

463
00:21:59,220 --> 00:22:00,010
No, please.

464
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:01,700
I'll send it! I'll send it!

465
00:22:09,370 --> 00:22:10,940
Dear, dinner is ready.

466
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:13,450
Lili, time for dinner!

467
00:22:21,570 --> 00:22:22,240
Mom,

468
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,330
I'm heading out for a bit.

469
00:22:23,330 --> 00:22:25,220
You're heading out without even eating?

470
00:22:25,220 --> 00:22:27,010
Your mom has already made dinner.

471
00:22:27,010 --> 00:22:28,540
Why are you going out to eat?

472
00:22:28,940 --> 00:22:30,670
Yun Ye is treating me to dinner.

473
00:22:31,220 --> 00:22:32,030
They haven't hung out alone

474
00:22:32,030 --> 00:22:33,180
for quite a while.

475
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:33,830
Just go ahead.

476
00:22:33,830 --> 00:22:34,610
Thanks, Mom.

477
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:37,920
Do you have enough money?

478
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,010
Yes, he pays.

479
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:41,140
You're just spoiling her.

480
00:22:43,270 --> 00:22:45,000
She'll grow up sooner or later.

481
00:22:49,330 --> 00:22:50,460
Here you are, Yun Li.

482
00:22:50,830 --> 00:22:51,880
Here, eat up.

483
00:22:54,940 --> 00:22:56,740
What? Are you trying to bribe me?

484
00:22:57,030 --> 00:22:58,030
Just take whatever

485
00:22:58,030 --> 00:22:58,940
you want to eat.

486
00:22:59,830 --> 00:23:02,010
It's rare for you to be so generous.

487
00:23:02,530 --> 00:23:04,330
Too bad I don't have much of an appetite.

488
00:23:04,330 --> 00:23:05,420
What's wrong?

489
00:23:05,740 --> 00:23:06,870
Are you in a bad mood?

490
00:23:06,980 --> 00:23:07,770
Nope.

491
00:23:07,980 --> 00:23:08,770
I'm fine.

492
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:10,610
You're fine?

493
00:23:11,830 --> 00:23:13,810
Then give me a smile.

494
00:23:14,940 --> 00:23:15,940
Keep pulling a long face,

495
00:23:15,940 --> 00:23:17,340
and you'll get wrinkles.

496
00:23:18,220 --> 00:23:19,880
You also get them if you smile.

497
00:23:20,270 --> 00:23:21,070
Never mind.

498
00:23:21,530 --> 00:23:22,640
If you really can't smile,

499
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:23,610
just forget about it.

500
00:23:23,610 --> 00:23:25,610
You look worse smiling than crying.

501
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:27,000
Pardon?

502
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,510
Li.

503
00:23:34,310 --> 00:23:35,110
If there's something

504
00:23:35,110 --> 00:23:35,940
you don't want to tell Mom and Dad,

505
00:23:35,940 --> 00:23:37,010
you can keep it from them.

506
00:23:37,010 --> 00:23:39,010
But you don't have to hide it from me.

507
00:23:39,110 --> 00:23:39,980
Just tell me!

508
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,010
Which jerk is it?

509
00:23:41,010 --> 00:23:42,410
I'll get revenge for you.

510
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:44,340
W-What are you talking about?

511
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:45,920
You can't fool me.

512
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:48,320
You must be having relationship problems.

513
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,810
I have sharp eyes.

514
00:23:52,310 --> 00:23:53,680
Have you finished your homework?

515
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:54,570
Have you reviewed your lessons?

516
00:23:54,570 --> 00:23:56,610
What was your score
on the mock exam this time?

517
00:23:56,610 --> 00:23:57,420
Li!

518
00:23:57,770 --> 00:23:59,030
Look at the way you are.

519
00:23:59,240 --> 00:24:01,300
I definitely hit the nail on the head.

520
00:24:04,290 --> 00:24:05,180
Just tell me

521
00:24:05,180 --> 00:24:06,240
which jerk

522
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,240
broke your heart!

523
00:24:07,740 --> 00:24:09,920
Kid, don't be so gossipy.

524
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:10,530
No, no,

525
00:24:10,530 --> 00:24:11,510
I'm not gossiping.

526
00:24:11,510 --> 00:24:13,110
I'm worried about you!

527
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:14,200
Just tell me...

528
00:24:19,310 --> 00:24:20,640
What are you looking at?

529
00:24:26,340 --> 00:24:27,800
Brat, who is that?

530
00:24:29,030 --> 00:24:30,420
Just a friend of mine.

531
00:24:30,420 --> 00:24:30,810
Your friend?

532
00:24:30,810 --> 00:24:33,010
Your friend is waiting for you outside?

533
00:24:34,030 --> 00:24:34,880
There's nothing between us.

534
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:35,510
Ask no more.

535
00:24:35,510 --> 00:24:36,110
This is fishy.

536
00:24:36,110 --> 00:24:36,510
Tell me.

537
00:24:36,510 --> 00:24:37,220
Come on.

538
00:24:49,620 --> 00:24:51,220
That's my sister in the shop.

539
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:00,680
Yunyi?

540
00:25:05,940 --> 00:25:08,010
Why didn't you go straight home
after school?

541
00:25:08,010 --> 00:25:09,340
What are you doing here?

542
00:25:10,610 --> 00:25:12,010
I came to grab some stuff.

543
00:25:13,310 --> 00:25:14,180
And this is...

544
00:25:16,030 --> 00:25:17,810
This is my classmate, Yun Ye.

545
00:25:18,860 --> 00:25:20,880
This is my brother, Yin Yucheng.

546
00:25:21,100 --> 00:25:21,900
Hello.

547
00:25:25,940 --> 00:25:26,940
Who is that?

548
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:28,310
Your classmate is

549
00:25:28,310 --> 00:25:30,710
working part-time at a convenience store?

550
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:32,720
High school studies are so demanding.

551
00:25:32,720 --> 00:25:34,420
How do you still have time
to work part-time?

552
00:25:34,420 --> 00:25:36,750
Didn't your family say anything about it?

553
00:25:39,140 --> 00:25:39,940
Yun Ye!

554
00:25:41,270 --> 00:25:41,940
Li.

555
00:25:46,010 --> 00:25:46,720
Hello,

556
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:49,030
I'm Yun Ye's sister, Yun Li.

557
00:25:51,180 --> 00:25:51,980
Hello.

558
00:25:52,310 --> 00:25:55,610
I'm Yunyi's brother, Yin Yucheng.

559
00:25:59,380 --> 00:26:00,310
Nice to meet you.

560
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:03,930
Yunyi just finished class.

561
00:26:03,930 --> 00:26:05,010
I happened to pass by

562
00:26:05,010 --> 00:26:06,510
and saw her at the convenience store,

563
00:26:06,510 --> 00:26:08,040
so I came over to take a look.

564
00:26:08,530 --> 00:26:09,980
Are Yunyi and Yun Ye

565
00:26:10,140 --> 00:26:11,380
in the same class?

566
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:14,170
We're in the same school
but different classes.

567
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:16,370
We just ran into each other

568
00:26:17,010 --> 00:26:18,140
and met not long ago.

569
00:26:18,140 --> 00:26:19,480
Yun Ye gets great grades.

570
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:20,070
Our teacher

571
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:21,730
praises him from time to time.

572
00:26:23,420 --> 00:26:24,350
Yun Ye's sister,

573
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:25,680
would you mind

574
00:26:26,310 --> 00:26:27,770
exchanging contact info?

575
00:26:28,220 --> 00:26:29,030
It seems that Yunyi

576
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:30,530
has made a very nice friend.

577
00:26:30,530 --> 00:26:32,430
We may as well add each other on WeChat

578
00:26:32,430 --> 00:26:35,030
to make it easier to communicate
in the future.

579
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:41,500
I'll scan your QR code.

580
00:26:46,420 --> 00:26:47,880
Then I will leave you to it.

581
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,300
I'll take my leave.

582
00:27:14,660 --> 00:27:15,590
Still staring?

583
00:27:16,030 --> 00:27:17,490
They're already far away.

584
00:27:18,300 --> 00:27:19,300
I wasn't staring.

585
00:27:19,850 --> 00:27:21,050
You weren't staring? Your eyes

586
00:27:21,050 --> 00:27:22,980
were literally glued to their car!

587
00:27:23,240 --> 00:27:24,240
Yun Ye, I'm warning you.

588
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,440
No dating at your age.

589
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:27,050
I already told you there was

590
00:27:27,050 --> 00:27:27,790
nothing between us.

591
00:27:27,790 --> 00:27:29,030
We're just classmates.

592
00:27:29,030 --> 00:27:30,400
There better be nothing.

593
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:32,060
Anyway, no dating at your age.

594
00:27:32,850 --> 00:27:34,180
And no working, either.

595
00:27:35,070 --> 00:27:35,550
Li.

596
00:27:35,790 --> 00:27:36,590
Li, Li...

597
00:27:36,790 --> 00:27:38,330
Li! Listen to me, Li.

598
00:27:39,590 --> 00:27:40,440
Everything's settled

599
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:41,570
with my job in Nanwu.

600
00:27:41,910 --> 00:27:43,070
Pack your things.

601
00:27:43,590 --> 00:27:45,050
We're getting ready to go.

602
00:27:45,750 --> 00:27:46,810
When?

603
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,300
In a couple of days.

604
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:54,250
I think Xifu is pretty good.

605
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:55,400
It'll surely

606
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:57,020
take you a while to get used
to a new place.

607
00:27:57,020 --> 00:27:58,220
But Nanwu definitely offers

608
00:27:58,220 --> 00:27:59,350
much better education

609
00:27:59,350 --> 00:28:01,210
and living conditions than Xifu.

610
00:28:02,090 --> 00:28:03,290
You'll like it there.

611
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:07,200
You're going into your senior year.

612
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:07,960
You need to fully focus

613
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:08,940
on your studies.

614
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:11,330
Don't let anything else distract you.

615
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,330
Where are you going?

616
00:28:29,460 --> 00:28:30,240
The library.

617
00:28:30,740 --> 00:28:32,150
The library?

618
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,940
You're not going on a date?

619
00:28:35,700 --> 00:28:36,880
Nope.

620
00:28:36,940 --> 00:28:38,540
Not going to work part-time?

621
00:28:38,740 --> 00:28:39,310
Nope.

622
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:41,000
For real?

623
00:28:41,900 --> 00:28:44,000
Look at you,
all dressed up in new clothes!

624
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:45,550
You even styled your hair, right?

625
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:46,290
I don't quite believe you.

626
00:28:46,290 --> 00:28:46,960
Let me see if there are

627
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:47,610
books in your bag.

628
00:28:47,610 --> 00:28:48,880
I told you I'm not going on a date.

629
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:49,480
Wait.

630
00:28:50,550 --> 00:28:51,290
Stay still.

631
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,530
I won't run. I won't.

632
00:28:52,530 --> 00:28:53,550
Hello, Jiameng.

633
00:28:53,940 --> 00:28:54,740
What's up?

634
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:56,500
Sorry, Yun Li.

635
00:28:56,530 --> 00:28:57,350
You're on leave,

636
00:28:57,350 --> 00:28:58,420
and I'm still bothering you.

637
00:28:58,420 --> 00:28:59,220
It's fine.

638
00:28:59,460 --> 00:29:00,260
Just go ahead.

639
00:29:00,590 --> 00:29:02,440
The company is sending someone

640
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:04,170
to Xifu to give a presentation.

641
00:29:04,390 --> 00:29:06,490
The boss asked me
to choose an assistant to go along.

642
00:29:06,490 --> 00:29:08,020
I've asked several people,

643
00:29:08,090 --> 00:29:09,840
but they either don't have time

644
00:29:10,030 --> 00:29:12,000
or are afraid of the person in charge.

645
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,330
They all turned me down.

646
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,930
I really had no other choice

647
00:29:14,930 --> 00:29:16,370
and had to turn to you.

648
00:29:17,290 --> 00:29:19,330
Who is the person in charge?

649
00:29:19,640 --> 00:29:20,680
Engineer Fu.

650
00:29:21,350 --> 00:29:23,330
Are you available?

651
00:29:24,140 --> 00:29:24,940
Don't worry!

652
00:29:24,940 --> 00:29:26,100
You won't work for nothing.

653
00:29:26,100 --> 00:29:28,230
Ms. Fang will record your attendance.

654
00:29:28,550 --> 00:29:29,790
Please do me a favor.

655
00:29:31,960 --> 00:29:33,290
I-I got it. Fine by me.

656
00:29:33,770 --> 00:29:34,920
Thank you, Yun Li.

657
00:29:35,330 --> 00:29:36,050
By the way,

658
00:29:36,050 --> 00:29:36,750
the new VR equipment

659
00:29:36,750 --> 00:29:37,740
we're bringing this time

660
00:29:37,740 --> 00:29:38,290
also needs to be

661
00:29:38,290 --> 00:29:39,960
filmed for the new game's promo clip.

662
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:41,620
Please arrange it. Thank you.

663
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:55,330
Grandma.

664
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:56,350
Are you tired?

665
00:29:56,350 --> 00:29:57,050
Nope.

666
00:29:57,790 --> 00:29:58,820
Let's sit and rest for a bit.

667
00:29:58,820 --> 00:29:59,310
Okay.

668
00:29:59,340 --> 00:30:00,600
Have something to eat.

669
00:30:10,830 --> 00:30:11,400
Grandma.

670
00:30:12,630 --> 00:30:13,560
Pineapple cake?

671
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:17,480
Your favorite pineapple cake.

672
00:30:27,570 --> 00:30:28,240
How is it?

673
00:30:28,590 --> 00:30:29,530
Any change in the taste?

674
00:30:29,530 --> 00:30:30,330
Nope.

675
00:30:31,060 --> 00:30:32,480
It tastes just as good.

676
00:30:47,740 --> 00:30:49,090
The pineapple cake

677
00:30:50,340 --> 00:30:51,650
has

678
00:30:51,670 --> 00:30:53,630
a thick, crispy crust outside

679
00:30:54,250 --> 00:30:55,700
and a soft filling

680
00:30:56,050 --> 00:30:57,570
inside.

681
00:30:59,140 --> 00:31:01,290
Isn't it just like some people?

682
00:31:02,350 --> 00:31:04,610
Tough on the outside, soft on the inside.

683
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:11,200
Without

684
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:14,090
this crust

685
00:31:14,090 --> 00:31:15,750
wrapping around the filling,

686
00:31:17,120 --> 00:31:18,650
it wouldn't hold its shape.

687
00:31:19,790 --> 00:31:22,400
A pineapple cake can't be all filling.

688
00:31:23,970 --> 00:31:25,890
So we can't blame people

689
00:31:26,300 --> 00:31:29,360
for wrapping themselves in a shell.

690
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,330
But if they do,

691
00:31:31,550 --> 00:31:32,500
it must be because

692
00:31:32,500 --> 00:31:34,050
they've been hurt before.

693
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:36,000
That's why they

694
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:39,010
hide their soft hearts.

695
00:31:42,050 --> 00:31:43,580
That's just the way you are,

696
00:31:44,010 --> 00:31:44,810
Shize.

697
00:31:52,940 --> 00:31:53,550
Grandma?

698
00:31:55,180 --> 00:31:55,940
Shize.

699
00:31:59,300 --> 00:32:00,640
I'm clear-headed now.

700
00:32:02,700 --> 00:32:04,900
I can feel that you're unhappy.

701
00:32:11,330 --> 00:32:12,480
You know what?

702
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:14,290
A hard shell

703
00:32:14,660 --> 00:32:15,470
sometimes

704
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:18,000
can protect you well.

705
00:32:18,830 --> 00:32:20,400
But it can also hurt

706
00:32:20,740 --> 00:32:23,280
those who truly want to get close to you.

707
00:32:26,030 --> 00:32:27,480
I hope that you

708
00:32:27,830 --> 00:32:29,330
can be yourself.

709
00:32:30,330 --> 00:32:32,500
Go after what you want,

710
00:32:32,900 --> 00:32:34,880
and say so when you like something.

711
00:32:35,500 --> 00:32:37,590
Let's not beat around the bush.

712
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:40,540
All that going in circles

713
00:32:40,730 --> 00:32:42,450
might make you

714
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,940
lose your good fortune.

715
00:32:44,390 --> 00:32:45,450
When that happens,

716
00:32:45,830 --> 00:32:47,720
it'll be too late to regret.

717
00:32:50,920 --> 00:32:51,720
Grandma.

718
00:32:54,930 --> 00:32:56,020
But I'm scared.

719
00:32:56,790 --> 00:32:57,980
Scared of what?

720
00:32:59,320 --> 00:33:01,320
Scared of being rejected,

721
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:02,530
or scared of

722
00:33:03,140 --> 00:33:04,800
exposing your true feelings?

723
00:33:06,430 --> 00:33:07,240
I'm scared...

724
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:13,370
I'm scared I'm not good enough.

725
00:33:13,740 --> 00:33:15,660
That's just what you think,

726
00:33:15,660 --> 00:33:16,510
Shize.

727
00:33:17,790 --> 00:33:20,030
Don't leave yourself with regrets.

728
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:23,000
I see.

729
00:33:24,460 --> 00:33:25,260
Look,

730
00:33:25,380 --> 00:33:27,240
how time flies.

731
00:33:27,530 --> 00:33:30,440
In the blink of an eye,
you've all grown up

732
00:33:30,900 --> 00:33:32,700
and gotten so tall.

733
00:33:33,330 --> 00:33:35,500
You're busy all day long,

734
00:33:35,590 --> 00:33:36,790
with no time

735
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:38,940
to spend with me.

736
00:33:42,400 --> 00:33:43,660
Don't worry, Grandma.

737
00:33:45,570 --> 00:33:47,170
I'll always be here with you.

738
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,860
I don't need you to be here with me.

739
00:33:50,500 --> 00:33:52,180
I just want you to be happy

740
00:33:52,770 --> 00:33:54,270
every day

741
00:33:54,380 --> 00:33:56,290
and have someone by your side.

742
00:33:56,500 --> 00:33:58,030
I'm long in the tooth,

743
00:33:58,380 --> 00:34:00,290
and my memory isn't as good
as it used to be.

744
00:34:00,290 --> 00:34:01,700
I'm always forgetting

745
00:34:01,700 --> 00:34:03,180
things.

746
00:34:03,530 --> 00:34:05,330
You young people are different.

747
00:34:05,570 --> 00:34:07,270
You have your own lives.

748
00:34:07,740 --> 00:34:09,070
All I want is for you

749
00:34:09,659 --> 00:34:10,530
to live

750
00:34:10,560 --> 00:34:11,840
your life well.

751
00:34:12,170 --> 00:34:14,230
You don't have to stay with me all day.

752
00:34:15,630 --> 00:34:16,440
Grandma,

753
00:34:17,530 --> 00:34:19,070
I want to stay with you.

754
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:22,270
Shize,

755
00:34:23,030 --> 00:34:24,690
you're such a good boy.

756
00:34:28,030 --> 00:34:29,570
It's about time.

757
00:34:30,050 --> 00:34:30,570
Come on,

758
00:34:30,630 --> 00:34:32,130
let's go back and eat.

759
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,030
Let's go.

760
00:34:39,900 --> 00:34:40,429
Let's go.

761
00:34:44,350 --> 00:34:45,120
It's so good.

762
00:34:51,690 --> 00:34:52,230
Done.

763
00:34:52,380 --> 00:34:53,840
Thank you. Have a good day.

764
00:34:56,820 --> 00:34:58,590
Hello, welcome.

765
00:35:10,420 --> 00:35:11,260
Yun Ye.

766
00:35:12,870 --> 00:35:15,400
You'll have to work hard
on your own next semester.

767
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:16,190
Why?

768
00:35:17,570 --> 00:35:19,630
I'm transferring to another school.

769
00:35:19,900 --> 00:35:21,900
Transferring? Where are you going?

770
00:35:22,340 --> 00:35:23,170
Nanwu.

771
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:25,480
Nanwu?

772
00:35:26,870 --> 00:35:29,370
When are you leaving then?

773
00:35:30,530 --> 00:35:31,340
Tomorrow.

774
00:35:32,170 --> 00:35:33,780
S-So soon?

775
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:40,800
Well, then...

776
00:35:42,070 --> 00:35:43,030
Is this our last time

777
00:35:43,030 --> 00:35:44,380
seeing each other?

778
00:35:52,770 --> 00:35:53,630
It's fine.

779
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:55,420
Nanwu isn't that far away.

780
00:35:55,500 --> 00:35:56,590
Anyway, remember to ask me

781
00:35:56,590 --> 00:35:58,510
if you have any problems with English.

782
00:35:58,510 --> 00:36:00,160
My English is pretty good.

783
00:36:04,600 --> 00:36:07,930
Occasionally, there are some questions
I'm not sure about.

784
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:14,940
I've got to go.

785
00:36:15,570 --> 00:36:17,500
My brother is still waiting for me.

786
00:36:18,190 --> 00:36:19,850
Then how do we stay in contact?

787
00:36:21,730 --> 00:36:23,130
You can write me letters.

788
00:36:24,190 --> 00:36:25,260
Write letters?

789
00:36:41,940 --> 00:36:43,120
Don't let me find you.

790
00:36:43,120 --> 00:36:44,450
How dare you bully Lili?

791
00:36:44,530 --> 00:36:46,660
I'll tear you into pieces if I find you.

792
00:36:48,170 --> 00:36:49,630
They're all alt accounts.

793
00:36:49,640 --> 00:36:51,040
How can I find the person?

794
00:36:52,250 --> 00:36:53,380
If that doesn't work,

795
00:36:53,380 --> 00:36:54,170
we can investigate

796
00:36:54,170 --> 00:36:55,830
their relationship with EAW.

797
00:36:57,610 --> 00:36:59,240
People related...

798
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:01,570
to EAW.

799
00:37:08,230 --> 00:37:09,380
Hello, Feifei.

800
00:37:09,590 --> 00:37:10,400
Zhengchu,

801
00:37:10,590 --> 00:37:11,840
do you want to come
and hang out tonight?

802
00:37:11,840 --> 00:37:13,770
We can celebrate
your discharge from the hospital.

803
00:37:13,770 --> 00:37:15,340
My foot hasn't fully healed yet.

804
00:37:15,340 --> 00:37:16,600
I'll take a rain check.

805
00:37:18,250 --> 00:37:19,060
Fine,

806
00:37:19,090 --> 00:37:20,130
then let's hang out

807
00:37:20,130 --> 00:37:20,920
when your leg is better.

808
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:21,460
Okay.

809
00:37:32,940 --> 00:37:34,270
Feng Feifei?

810
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:37,200
Let's start with you.

811
00:37:37,910 --> 00:37:39,020
This is great.

812
00:37:39,040 --> 00:37:40,030
The one who planned this event

813
00:37:40,030 --> 00:37:41,170
is so talented.

814
00:37:45,190 --> 00:37:46,420
Eat all of this.

815
00:37:50,540 --> 00:37:51,380
This is a large portion.

816
00:37:51,380 --> 00:37:52,430
Are you feeding an army?

817
00:37:52,430 --> 00:37:54,100
You are what you eat.

818
00:37:54,130 --> 00:37:54,940
Just eat up.

819
00:37:56,010 --> 00:37:56,500
Such nourishment

820
00:37:56,500 --> 00:37:57,690
is too much.

821
00:37:58,670 --> 00:37:59,380
People say

822
00:37:59,380 --> 00:38:01,730
it takes 100 days
to recover from a bone injury.

823
00:38:01,730 --> 00:38:02,670
If you want to get better soon,

824
00:38:02,670 --> 00:38:03,750
just eat it all.

825
00:38:34,910 --> 00:38:36,200
From Nanwu to Xifu,

826
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:37,730
there are 4 flights a day.

827
00:38:38,980 --> 00:38:39,690
How do I know

828
00:38:39,690 --> 00:38:41,150
which flight he's taking?

829
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:44,410
The morning flight?

830
00:38:44,440 --> 00:38:45,280
That's too early.

831
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:46,230
N-No way.

832
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,920
If I were him, I would take...

833
00:38:49,380 --> 00:38:50,380
the noon flight.

834
00:38:51,480 --> 00:38:53,340
But what if he just takes
the morning flight?

835
00:38:53,340 --> 00:38:55,200
Then I won't be able to pick him up.

836
00:38:59,260 --> 00:38:59,840
Forget it.

837
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:00,940
It's only 5 hours.

838
00:39:22,980 --> 00:39:25,230
The next flight is in 2 hours.

839
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:27,280
I'll wait.

840
00:39:27,900 --> 00:39:29,700
I've already waited for 3 hours.

841
00:39:58,530 --> 00:40:00,060
Jiameng must have told you.

842
00:40:00,630 --> 00:40:02,500
I'll be the assistant
for the presentation.

843
00:40:02,500 --> 00:40:04,100
I'm here to pick you up today.

844
00:40:06,730 --> 00:40:07,500
I...

845
00:40:10,070 --> 00:40:12,000
I didn't tell her my flight number.

846
00:40:13,980 --> 00:40:15,160
I-I parked my car over there.

847
00:40:15,160 --> 00:40:15,700
Let's go.

848
00:40:38,040 --> 00:40:39,820
You can rest in the passenger seat.

849
00:40:39,820 --> 00:40:40,530
I'll drive.

850
00:40:42,340 --> 00:40:42,940
Mm.

851
00:40:54,630 --> 00:40:56,030
Are we going to the hotel?

852
00:40:56,780 --> 00:40:58,040
Let's go to XUST first.

853
00:41:21,570 --> 00:41:22,340
Is there any work

854
00:41:22,340 --> 00:41:23,320
you need me to do?

855
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:29,480
I've got all the materials ready

856
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:30,810
for this presentation.

857
00:41:32,140 --> 00:41:34,240
Please format the materials,
design the cover,

858
00:41:34,240 --> 00:41:35,670
and contact a print shop
to have them printed and bound.

859
00:41:35,670 --> 00:41:36,920
We need 100 copies in total.

860
00:41:36,920 --> 00:41:37,510
Okay.

861
00:41:38,040 --> 00:41:39,370
Is there anything else?

862
00:41:46,860 --> 00:41:48,110
I'll get some sleep first.

863
00:41:48,110 --> 00:41:49,510
Wake me up when we arrive.

864
00:41:56,250 --> 00:41:56,960
Shize,

865
00:41:58,110 --> 00:41:59,500
I hope that you

866
00:42:00,050 --> 00:42:01,320
can be yourself.

867
00:42:02,570 --> 00:42:04,980
Say so when you like something.

868
00:42:05,940 --> 00:42:08,080
Let's not beat around the bush.

869
00:42:09,320 --> 00:42:11,230
All that going in circles

870
00:42:11,390 --> 00:42:13,140
might make you

871
00:42:13,170 --> 00:42:14,630
lose your good fortune.

872
00:42:15,490 --> 00:42:16,550
When that happens,

873
00:42:16,820 --> 00:42:18,510
it'll be too late to regret.

874
00:42:20,080 --> 00:42:22,170
Don't leave yourself with regrets.

875
00:43:35,610 --> 00:43:37,050
We've reached XUST?

876
00:43:38,650 --> 00:43:39,260
Mm.

877
00:43:43,340 --> 00:43:45,140
I slept here for an hour?

878
00:43:46,980 --> 00:43:47,610
Nope.

879
00:43:47,930 --> 00:43:49,260
There was a traffic jam.

880
00:43:52,510 --> 00:43:53,610
I'll get going then.

881
00:43:53,610 --> 00:43:55,470
You may go straight home and rest.

882
00:43:56,550 --> 00:43:58,010
It's inconvenient for you
to carry your luggage.

883
00:43:58,010 --> 00:43:59,870
Let me take it to the hotel for you.

884
00:44:01,110 --> 00:44:01,910
Don't bother.

885
00:44:01,980 --> 00:44:02,780
It's nothing.

886
00:44:03,460 --> 00:44:04,550
I'll leave it at the front desk.

887
00:44:04,550 --> 00:44:06,090
You can pick it up when you get there.

888
00:44:06,090 --> 00:44:06,900
Go ahead.

889
00:44:09,440 --> 00:44:10,040
Thank you.
